Osmo Nano no longer shows zoom controls, and DISP settings only list Zoom Chip and Gimbal Stick when the camera has them. New: Osmo Action 6 support with live view, Normal 10-bit and D-Log M color with the official LUT, and an APERTURE control in place of FOCUS (not yet checked on a real Action 6). Also new: experimental Multiview for up to four Pocket or Nano cameras. Fixed: live video stopping shortly after connecting, and clip delete in playback. Scopes and playback use less power.
